          "id": 53,
          "raw": "This is an automated message.\n\nThe new user [user0](/u/user0) tried to create multiple posts with links to deals.example.com, but those posts were blocked to avoid spam. The user is still able to create new posts that do not link to deals.example.com.\n\nPlease [review the user](/u/user0).\n\nThis can be modified via the `newuser_spam_host_threshold` and `allowed_spam_host_domains` site settings. Consider adding deals.example.com to the allowlist if they should be exempt.",
          "wiki": false,
          "reads": 1,
          "score": null,
          "cooked": "<p>This is an automated message.</p>\n<p>The new user <a href=\"/u/user0\">user0</a> tried to create multiple posts with links to <a href=\"http://deals.example.com\">deals.example.com</a>, but those posts were blocked to avoid spam. The user is still able to create new posts that do not link to <a href=\"http://deals.example.com\">deals.example.com</a>.</p>\n<p>Please <a href=\"/u/user0\">review the user</a>.</p>\n<p>This can be modified via the <code>newuser_spam_host_threshold</code> and <code>allowed_spam_host_domains</code> site settings. Consider adding <a href=\"http://deals.example.com\">deals.example.com</a> to the allowlist if they should be exempt.</p>",
